### N:M Product <-> Supplier
### 1. Add a second supplier to product 1 (replace ids with ones that exist)
PUT http://localhost:8085/v1/products/1/suppliers/2

### 2. All suppliers of a product
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/products/1/suppliers

### 3. TEST SCENARIO: all products of a supplier
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/suppliers/2/products

### 4. Remove the supplier from the product again (product and supplier are kept)
DELETE http://localhost:8085/v1/products/1/suppliers/2


### 1:1 Customer <-> CustomerProfile
### 5. Create the profile of customer 1 (PUT creates or updates)
PUT http://localhost:8085/v1/customers/1/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "birth_date": "2000-05-17",
  "newsletter_subscribed": true,
  "preferred_language": "fi"
}

### 6. Read the profile
GET http://localhost:8085/v1/customers/1/profile

### 7. Delete the profile (the customer is kept)
DELETE http://localhost:8085/v1/customers/1/profile
